about+=f'<section class="section pt-0"><div class="wrap story"><div class="story-photo"><img src="/assets/pippin.jpg" alt="Pippin, founder of The Snippitypip" width="1200" height="1600"></div><div><span class="eyebrow">Hair stylist. Extension specialist. Scalp practitioner.</span><h2>A passion for hair.<br><em>A care for people.</em></h2><p class="muted">With over 20 years in hairdressing, Pippin brings knowledge, creativity and technical expertise to every appointment. Her career with the Toni &amp; Guy group includes experience affiliated with Essensuals Toni &amp; Guy in Covent Garden, London, and work throughout Devon and Cornwall.</p><p class="muted">Since leaving Toni &amp; Guy, she has built her own business around a more personal, one-to-one service. She takes the time to understand each client’s hair, lifestyle and goals, offering thoughtful advice and a warm welcome.</p><p class="muted">Her work spans technical hair services, advanced cutting and styling, and occasion hair, including bridal hair-ups. Whether you are exploring a new colour, bespoke extensions, mesh integration or scalp care, the focus is on beautiful, manageable results that feel right for you.</p><p class="muted">Pippin prides herself on outstanding customer service, long-lasting relationships and a loyal clientele. Her care, commitment to continued learning and love of her craft are at the heart of The Snippitypip.</p><div class="signature">Pippin</div>{link("Find your next appointment","/salon.html")}</div></div></section>'
